----------------------------------------------------

Texture types (2.9), samplers (2.10), atomic types (2.6), pixel types (2.7), imageblocks (2.11), arrays (2.12.1), the uniform type (2.14), function tables (2.15), ray-tracing types (2.17), interpolants (2.18), mesh types (2.20), command buffers (6.17) and tensors (2.22). Template names like array and mesh are only class names before a template argument list.
